---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="System Architecture & Technical Blueprint | Dual Shield" activePage="architecture">

	<!-- SECTION 1: HEADER -->
	<section class="section-padding bg-canvas border-b border-stone-200/80 relative z-10">
		<div class="container-custom">
			<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
				<span class="badge-chip badge-sky">
					<i class="fa-solid fa-microchip" style="font-size: 0.625rem;"></i> TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION
				</span>
				<span class="badge-chip badge-stone">
					OFFLINE-FIRST EDGE ARCHITECTURE
				</span>
			</div>
			
			<h1 class="hero-title" style="max-width: 52rem;">
				Edge Hardware & <span class="italic font-normal text-accent">FHIR-Compliant</span> Intelligence Engine.
			</h1>

			<p class="hero-subtitle">
				A rigorous technical blueprint detailing how offline-first hardware and standardized FHIR schemas power the decision support and unit quality modules.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- SECTION 2: HARDWARE SPECIFICATION (Edge Layer) -->
	<section class="section-padding" style="background-color: var(--bg-canvas-muted); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-stone);">
		<div class="container-custom">
			
			<div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
				<div class="badge-chip badge-teal mb-2">
					<i class="fa-solid fa-hard-drive" style="font-size: 0.625rem;"></i>
					<span>EDGE HARDWARE LAYER</span>
				</div>
				<h2 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3rem); font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-dark); margin-top: 0.5rem;">
					Four Bedside Physical Modules
				</h2>
				<p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9375rem; font-weight: 300; max-width: 36rem; margin-top: 0.5rem;">
					Standalone microcontroller-driven bedside hardware units communicating locally via low-latency MQTT over isolated unit LAN.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- 4 Hardware Cards Grid -->
			<div class="grid-2">
				
				<!-- Module 1: Biometric Registration -->
				<div class="card-white" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
					<div>
						<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
							<div style="width: 3rem; height: 3rem; border-radius: 1rem; background-color: #F0F9FF; color: var(--accent-sky); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700;">
								<i class="fa-solid fa-fingerprint"></i>
							</div>
							<div>
								<div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.6875rem; color: var(--text-light); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;">MODULE 01</div>
								<h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-dark);">Biometric Registration & Shift Scheduling</h3>
							</div>
						</div>
						<p style="font-size: 0.9375rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
							Optical fingerprint scanner integrated with a local embedded SQLite database for instant patient identification at bed arrival.
						</p>
					</div>
					<ul style="list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted); background-color: var(--bg-canvas-muted); padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--border-stone);">
						<li>• <strong>Shift Queue Rules:</strong> Automated station assignment based on nurse ratio.</li>
						<li>• <strong>Audio Feedback:</strong> Distinct chime tones distinguishing patient arrival vs staff override.</li>
						<li>• <strong>Offline Caching:</strong> Stores 500+ local biometric hashes during network drops.</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<!-- Module 2: Weight & Sensor IV Alert System -->
				<div class="card-white" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
					<div>
						<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
							<div style="width: 3rem; height: 3rem; border-radius: 1rem; background-color: #ECFDF5; color: var(--accent-emerald); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700;">
								<i class="fa-solid fa-weight-scale"></i>
							</div>
							<div>
								<div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.6875rem; color: var(--text-light); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;">MODULE 02</div>
								<h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-dark);">Weight & Sensor-Based IV Alert System</h3>
							</div>
						</div>
						<p style="font-size: 0.9375rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
							Precision load-cell strain gauge sensors continuously tracking IV bag infusion mass to prevent air embolism and line blockage.
						</p>
					</div>
					<ul style="list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted); background-color: var(--bg-canvas-muted); padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--border-stone);">
						<li>• <strong>Mass Tracking:</strong> Real-time drip rate calculation (±0.5g precision).</li>
						<li>• <strong>Line Stall Trigger:</strong> Visual strobe & audio buzzer if infusion halts prematurely.</li>
						<li>• <strong>Empty State Alarm:</strong> 5-minute pre-empty notification to nurse terminal.</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<!-- Module 3: Wireless Auto-Injection Module -->
				<div class="card-white" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
					<div>
						<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
							<div style="width: 3rem; height: 3rem; border-radius: 1rem; background-color: #F3E8FF; color: var(--accent-purple); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700;">
								<i class="fa-solid fa-syringe"></i>
							</div>
							<div>
								<div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.6875rem; color: var(--text-light); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;">MODULE 03</div>
								<h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-dark);">Wireless Auto-Injection Module</h3>
							</div>
						</div>
						<p style="font-size: 0.9375rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
							Closed-loop automated heparin/epogen delivery concept verifying patient identity and scheduled administration windows before release.
						</p>
					</div>
					<ul style="list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted); background-color: var(--bg-canvas-muted); padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--border-stone);">
						<li>• <strong>2-Factor Verification:</strong> Nurse badge scan + doctor digital signature check.</li>
						<li>• <strong>Schedule Locks:</strong> Solenoid valve lock preventing early or duplicate dosage.</li>
						<li>• <strong>Audit Logging:</strong> Timestamped dose log broadcast to FHIR record store.</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<!-- Module 4: Machine Telemetry Bridge -->
				<div class="card-white" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
					<div>
						<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
							<div style="width: 3rem; height: 3rem; border-radius: 1rem; background-color: #F0FDF4; color: var(--accent-teal); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700;">
								<i class="fa-solid fa-network-wired"></i>
							</div>
							<div>
								<div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.6875rem; color: var(--text-light); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;">MODULE 04</div>
								<h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-dark);">Machine Telemetry Bridge</h3>
							</div>
						</div>
						<p style="font-size: 0.9375rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
							Direct RS-232 serial and Ethernet interface capturing live machine parameters directly from dialyzer units (e.g. Fresenius 4008S).
						</p>
					</div>
					<ul style="list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted); background-color: var(--bg-canvas-muted); padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--border-stone);">
						<li>• <strong>Parameters Streamed:</strong> Transmembrane Pressure (TMP), Blood Flow Rate (Qb), Dialysate Flow (Qd).</li>
						<li>• <strong>Sampling Rate:</strong> 1 Hz continuous polling with local packet smoothing.</li>
						<li>• <strong>Zero Manual Entry:</strong> Eliminates paper transcription of machine numbers.</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- SECTION 3: SOFTWARE LAYER (Tabbed Architecture Layout) -->
	<section class="section-padding" style="background-color: var(--bg-canvas);" x-data="{ activeTab: 'fhir' }">
		<div class="container-custom">
			
			<div style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
				<div class="badge-chip badge-sky mb-2">
					<i class="fa-solid fa-code" style="font-size: 0.625rem;"></i>
					<span>SOFTWARE LAYER</span>
				</div>
				<h2 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3rem); font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-dark); margin-top: 0.5rem;">
					Software & Intelligence Engine
				</h2>
				<p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9375rem; font-weight: 300; max-width: 36rem; margin-top: 0.5rem;">
					Explore the 4 core software modules driving clinical decision support and unit surveillance.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Interactive Alpine Tabs Navigation Pill Bar -->
			<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; background-color: var(--bg-canvas-muted); padding: 0.375rem; border-radius: 9999px; border: 1px solid var(--border-stone); max-width: fit-content;">
				<button @click="activeTab = 'fhir'" x-bind:class="activeTab === 'fhir' ? 'bg-dark text-canvas shadow-sm' : 'text-stone-600 hover:text-dark'" style="padding: 0.625rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 9999px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; border: none; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s ease;">
					Tab 1: Global FHIR Store
				</button>
				<button @click="activeTab = 'nurse'" x-bind:class="activeTab === 'nurse' ? 'bg-dark text-canvas shadow-sm' : 'text-stone-600 hover:text-dark'" style="padding: 0.625rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 9999px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; border: none; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s ease;">
					Tab 2: Nurse Terminal
				</button>
				<button @click="activeTab = 'doctor'" x-bind:class="activeTab === 'doctor' ? 'bg-dark text-canvas shadow-sm' : 'text-stone-600 hover:text-dark'" style="padding: 0.625rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 9999px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; border: none; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s ease;">
					Tab 3: Doctor Console
				</button>
				<button @click="activeTab = 'quality'" x-bind:class="activeTab === 'quality' ? 'bg-dark text-canvas shadow-sm' : 'text-stone-600 hover:text-dark'" style="padding: 0.625rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 9999px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; border: none; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s ease;">
					Tab 4: Ward Quality Module
				</button>
			</div>

			<!-- Tab 1: Global FHIR-Compliant Store -->
			<div x-show="activeTab === 'fhir'" x-transition class="card-white" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
				<div style="max-width: 48rem;">
					<div class="badge-chip badge-sky mb-2">STANDARDIZED DATA ARCHITECTURE</div>
					<h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-dark); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Global FHIR-Compliant Store (HL7 v4)</h3>
					<p style="font-size: 0.9375rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.65; font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
						Built on HL7 FHIR Release 4 JSON schemas (`Patient`, `Observation`, `DeviceMetric`, `MedicationRequest`). Utilizes a dual-database architecture: local SQLite edge nodes for immediate offline bedside rendering, paired with asynchronous PostgreSQL cloud synchronization when network connectivity is restored.
					</p>

					<div style="background-color: #0F172A; color: #38BDF8; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 1rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; overflow-x: auto; line-height: 1.6; border: 1px solid #334155;">
						<div style="color: #64748B;">// FHIR DeviceMetric JSON Schema Preview</div>
						<div>&#123;</div>
						<div style="padding-left: 1rem;">"resourceType": <span style="color: #FCD34D;">"DeviceMetric"</span>,</div>
						<div style="padding-left: 1rem;">"id": <span style="color: #FCD34D;">"bedside-dialysate-tmp-04"</span>,</div>
						<div style="padding-left: 1rem;">"type": &#123; <span style="color: #FCD34D;">"text": "Transmembrane Pressure"</span> &#125;,</div>
						<div style="padding-left: 1rem;">"unit": &#123; <span style="color: #FCD34D;">"coding": [&#123; "code": "mm[Hg]" &#125;]</span> &#125;,</div>
						<div style="padding-left: 1rem;">"operationalStatus": <span style="color: #34D399;">"on"</span>,</div>
						<div style="padding-left: 1rem;">"measurementFrequency": <span style="color: #FCD34D;">"1 Hz"</span></div>
						<div>&#125;</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Tab 2: Nurse Operations Terminal -->
			<div x-show="activeTab === 'nurse'" x-transition class="card-white" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
				<div style="max-width: 48rem;">
					<div class="badge-chip badge-teal mb-2">BEDSIDE OPERATIONS</div>
					<h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-dark); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Nurse Operations Terminal</h3>
					<p style="font-size: 0.9375rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.65; font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
						Touch-optimized counter-mounted and mobile nursing interface displaying an active shift bed matrix, automated doctor order execution queues, medication timing timers, and 1-tap incident logging.
					</p>

					<div class="grid-2" style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem;">
						<div style="background-color: var(--bg-canvas-muted); padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 0.75rem; border: 1px solid var(--border-stone);">
							<strong style="color: var(--text-dark);">ACTIVE BED MATRIX:</strong>
							<p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 0.25rem;">At-a-glance status grid for 12 beds showing real-time vitals & risk scores.</p>
						</div>
						<div style="background-color: var(--bg-canvas-muted); padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 0.75rem; border: 1px solid var(--border-stone);">
							<strong style="color: var(--text-dark);">1-TAP INCIDENT LOG:</strong>
							<p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 0.25rem;">Instant timestamped logging of patient dizziness, cramping, or line issues.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Tab 3: Doctor Clinical Console -->
			<div x-show="activeTab === 'doctor'" x-transition class="card-white" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
				<div style="max-width: 48rem;">
					<div class="badge-chip badge-sky mb-2">LONGITUDINAL DECISION SUPPORT</div>
					<h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-dark); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Doctor Clinical Console</h3>
					<p style="font-size: 0.9375rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.65; font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
						Comprehensive longitudinal trend analytics visualizing multi-month dry weight trajectories, hemoglobin trends, and adequacy markers (Kt/V). Features dynamic dry weight recalibration tools and MedGemma renal dosage safety checks.
					</p>

					<div style="background-color: #F3E8FF; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 1rem; border: 1px solid #E9D5FF; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-dark);">
						<div style="color: #9333EA; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">[DYNAMIC DRY WEIGHT RECALIBRATION MODEL]</div>
						<p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 0;">Calculates interdialytic weight gain (IDWG) velocity across 12 sequential sessions to differentiate fluid retention from actual tissue loss.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Tab 4: Systemic Unit Quality Module -->
			<div x-show="activeTab === 'quality'" x-transition class="card-white" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
				<div style="max-width: 48rem;">
					<div class="badge-chip badge-rose mb-2">WARD-LEVEL SURVEILLANCE</div>
					<h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-dark); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Systemic Unit Quality Module</h3>
					<p style="font-size: 0.9375rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.65; font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
						A real-time cross-station anomaly detection engine that monitors collective telemetry across all active beds to flag electrolyte drops, water purification failures, and equipment defects before widespread harm occurs.
					</p>

					<div style="background-color: #FFE4E6; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 1rem; border: 1px solid #FECDD3; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: #E11D48;">
						<div style="font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;"><i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"></i> CROSS-STATION ANOMALY RULE:</div>
						<p style="margin-bottom: 0;">If >= 3 adjacent stations display a simultaneous conductivity drop > 0.5 mS/cm, trigger immediate ward-wide water treatment loop alarm.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

		</div>
	</section>

</Layout>
